{"id":"1283096688291241984","date":"2020-07-14","url":"https://x.com/adamdangelo/status/1283096688291241984","author":"adamdangelo","text":"The Greymatter podcast this week has an interview with me about Quora's shift to being a remote first company.","quoted":{"url":"https://x.com/GreylockVC/status/1283091867232399360","text":"Prior to #covid19, work at @quora was centered around the office. But #wfh has been so successful, @adamdangelo decided to make that the default going forward. Hear more about this decision on the latest episode of #greymatter\nhttps://t.co/VjMArW6Qeh https://t.co/3PYcRiFy36"},"live_status":200,"archived_at":"20200714182854","archive":"https://web.archive.org/web/20200714182854/https://twitter.com/adamdangelo/status/1283096688291241984","via":"wayback","read_at":"2026-09-30"}
