{"id":"1276210619394318336","date":"2020-06-25","url":"https://x.com/adamdangelo/status/1276210619394318336","author":"adamdangelo","text":"I have shared more about our reasoning and the benefits I see for Quora, our employees, and society more broadly in this blog post: https://t.co/h62dnJvrUs (2/2)","reply_to":"adamdangelo","live_status":200,"archived_at":"20200625180210","archive":"https://web.archive.org/web/20200625180210/https://twitter.com/adamdangelo/status/1276210619394318336","via":"wayback","read_at":"2026-09-30"}
{"id":"1276210618786168833","date":"2020-06-25","url":"https://x.com/adamdangelo/status/1276210618786168833","author":"adamdangelo","text":"We are going fully remote first at Quora. Most of our employees have opted not to return to the office post-covid, I will not work out of the office, our leadership teams will not be located in the office, and all policies will orient around remote work. (1/2)","live_status":200,"archived_at":"20200625175929","archive":"https://web.archive.org/web/20200625175929/https://twitter.com/adamdangelo/status/1276210618786168833","via":"wayback","read_at":"2026-09-30"}
