{"id":"1241757534332960769","date":"2020-03-22","url":"https://x.com/adamdangelo/status/1241757534332960769","author":"adamdangelo","text":"1) A lot of people are trying to forecast the coronavirus impact on Q2 US GDP right now. I have one small piece to add to the conversation. There is a Goldman Sachs forecast from Friday that is being widely misreported as -24% from Q1 to Q2. The forecast is actually for -7%.","live_status":200,"archived_at":"20200322172415","archive":"https://web.archive.org/web/20200322172415/https://twitter.com/adamdangelo/status/1241757534332960769","via":"wayback","read_at":"2026-09-30"}
